WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.401
Apply SAFE, FACTS and IMPACT, TRACE and PAUSE

00:00:04.581 --> 00:00:08.174
to the observed result. Keep the map, guidance,

00:00:08.399 --> 00:00:12.485
automation screen, data controls, impact review and decision

00:00:12.665 --> 00:00:17.321
consistent. Retain normal, error and exception results, correction

00:00:17.636 --> 00:00:23.429
and retest, safeguards, monitoring, residual risks and maintenance.

00:00:23.879 --> 00:00:26.708
Name who owns, stops and corrects the system

00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:29.358
and what evidence and approval are needed before

00:00:29.538 --> 00:00:33.362
wider use. Demonstrate a functioning correction or fallback

00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:36.461
within the stated test type. Save the same

00:00:36.506 --> 00:00:39.291
project and workbook, then carry the evidence into

00:00:39.425 --> 00:00:40.225
Journey Six.
